        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Grade:</b> 8th Grade (CEFR: A2.3)</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Scenario:</b> Books and Movies</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px dashed #333;"><b>Theme:</b> I Liked Your Presentation Because...</td>
    </tr>
